# `artifacts.list`

Artifact metadata records, filterable by scope/mime/collection/item/owner.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.artifacts.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `scope` | `string?` | no |
| `mime` | `string?` | no |
| `collection_id` | `string?` | no |
| `item_id` | `string?` | no |
| `owner_actor` | `string?` | no |
| `content_hash` | `string?` | no |
| `sort` | `string?` | no |
| `limit` | `number?` | no |
| `offset` | `number?` | no |

## Returns

